flowchart TB
  operator[Authorized operator / private-connected runner] --> state[Separate encrypted S3 state / lockfile / KMS]
  operator --> api[Private EKS API / access entries]
  github[GitHub exact repository and branch OIDC] --> publish[Optional ECR publisher role]
  publish --> ecr[Immutable KMS-encrypted ECR repositories]
  subgraph vpc[Environment VPC - proposed, not provisioned]
    subgraph public[Public subnets across two AZs]
      nat[Optional one or per-AZ NAT / EIPs]
      igw[Internet gateway]
    end
    subgraph private[Private subnets across two AZs]
      nodes[Managed AL2023 nodes / encrypted EBS / IMDSv2]
      endpoints[Optional private AWS endpoints / S3 gateway]
      logsIdentity[Optional scoped Pod Identity log writer]
    end
    nodes --> nat
    nat --> igw
    nodes --> endpoints
    nodes --> api
    nodes --> ecr
    logsIdentity --> logs[Encrypted CloudWatch groups / audit metric / flow logs]
  end
  existingLB[Separately approved existing internal LB / TLS] --> dns[Optional existing-zone CNAME]
  api --> logs
  state -.-> approval[Separate cost and plan approval before any apply]
